abstract: "Volumetric Logic (VL) is a geometry-first decision formalism for deterministic signals in R^n based on finite collections of weighted closed balls and a normalized radial proximity operator. The framework develops formal semantics, logical structure, embedding into zero-order fuzzy inference systems, constructive approximation results for Lipschitz functions, and efficient O(kn) evaluation."